cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Council policies by area: section 19, EOTAS and alternative provision"
abstract: >-
  A reference dataset of what the 153 local authorities in England responsible for education
  publish about education for children who cannot attend school: their section 19 or medical needs
  policy, their EOTAS policy or guidance, what they publish about alternative provision, and the
  free local SEND advice service for the area. It holds 612 entries, one for each of the four
  kinds for each authority, each with the date it was checked. It records what each council
  publishes as found on the dates shown; it does not describe what any policy says.
authors:
  - name: "James Wallace Education"
